    ['The Emancipation Proclamation (1863)…', 'declared enslaved people in the rebel Confederate states free', ['ended the Civil War', 'gave all women the vote', 'created the Confederacy'], 'Slavery was abolished everywhere by the 13th Amendment in 1865.']
